      "name": "dsh-macro-memory",
      "title": {
        "en": "Macro Memory",
        "zh": "宏记忆"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "One memory plugin instead of three: 8 unified memory_* tools and a single 1,091-character injection, with meow-memory's seven-layer SQLite as the main store and a rebuildable graph index. Tool schemas 56,759 B → 8,655 B (−84.7%), standing prompt 4,085 → 1,091 chars (−73.3%). Nothing was dropped: writes land in the main store first, graph links that cannot be written are queued instead of lost, and the setting page takes effect without a restart.",
        "zh": "一个记忆插件顶三个：8 个统一 memory_* 工具 + 一段 1,091 字符常驻注入，主库仍是 meow-memory 的七层 SQLite，星图退成可重建的索引。工具 schema 56,759 B → 8,655 B（−84.7%），常驻注入 4,085 → 1,091 字符（−73.3%）。能力一条没砍：写入先落主库，连不上星图的连线排队不丢，设置页改完即刻生效、不用重启。"
      },
